Z||000004||avengador1||11-04-2001||09:24 PM||||Isn't it obvious? Computers!!! I have three that I built myself all networked together. I have my own LAN.I have a 3Com hub and DSL modem so I don't tie up the phone line. My wife, my son, and myself can be on at the same time and it doesn't affect the speed. I get a connection speed @ 1300 Kb/sec and have connected as high as 1500 Kb/sec. It's the only way to fly... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
