Z||000006||Nashco||11-04-2001||09:45 PM||||Well, seems like Cliff and I have a little in common, in that we have so many hobbies!  I haven't got too far into a lot of them, but I'm always fiddling with something.  I guess I'd say my number one hobby is learning.  I love to learn new stuff, and as a result I'm always on the internet researching something..anything..just learning.  I haven't heard of anybody suffering from information overload, and I can't deny that I wish I knew more about everything <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I entertain my passion for learning through tweaking and modifying my '69 VW Bug, my GT, and helping friends with countless projects.  I used to be able to focus on one project well, but anymore it seems they're all too interesting to ignore <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
