Z||000021||BN Boomer||11-05-2001||12:52 PM||||My biggest hobby is guns. Collecting, shooting, reloading.... I also like to hunt deer and elk.<P>I've put together a modest home theater system and have been building up a collection of DVDs over the last year.<P>I collect bits and pieces of railroad artifacts/memorabilia as I come across them, mostly at work.<P>And as soon as I find a good deal on a Jeep CJ-8 Scrambler in reasonable condition, I'm going to get back into in Jeeping/offroading in a big way. When I do, I might even have to sell the Fiero to keep the peace in the house.<P>------------------<BR>Greg, aka Boomer<BR>Red 85 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.gmemd.com/locomotives/naf/images/sd70sm.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||Darren's 87 coupe||11-05-2001||08:22 PM||||Acting and all theater stuff<P>I've been in over 80 plays, some local commercials, musicals, lots of shakespeare, stunt shows, tech theater, and now directing.  Shakespeare is a lot of passion.  I've done 11 different ones and Hamlet 3 times.  Hamlet is my favorite.<P>I also just remodeled our house in Tulsa that we just made into a rent house.  I have a lake home that needs a lot of work.  I like carpentry and small crafts.  Models and such.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blueman_copy_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000023||Jake_Dragon||11-05-2001||09:02 PM||||Lets see I have 5 computers in my house and a stack of PC equipment that I will probably never use. Yes I am a computer geek.<P>I have collected knives and started collecting swords. &lt;&lt;&lt;expensive&gt;&gt;&gt;<BR>I get Band-Aids for Christmas.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/left.gif">                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif">                 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/right.gif">        <BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gt.GIF"> ||||reg||1
Z||000024||AkursedX||11-05-2001||09:44 PM||||Hmmm I would have to say my favorite thing to do is people watch.  I love going to different places of the city and just listening to people's conversations.  You can learn some interesting things. <P>I also do makeup for my friends.  If it is not known already, I'm a freak, and I wear makeup as well, and apparently I seem to have a knack for it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I also read constantly.  I used to read lots of Fantasy-type books.  R.A. salvatore is my favorite author.  But my reading has become more academic as of late and I've been focusing on all sorts of books within the sociology field, deviance in particular.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000025||Raydar||11-05-2001||09:49 PM||||Computer/electronics geek. Have built three computers this year. None of them let any smoke escape. <BR> <BR>Carpentry. Built a room in the basement to use for an electronics shop. <BR>(Gonna start repairing/rebuilding Delco radios.) <BR>About to make some other mods to the house, as well. <P>Used to ride murdercycles until I realized that the yahoos in Atlanta can't even see <I>other cars</I>, half the time. <BR>Never crashed once. Didn't want to push my luck.<P>Guns. Military stuff and semi-auto handguns. Very small time. (This premesis patrolled by armed guard three days a week. You guess which three.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>Also have a few dozen Hot Wheels and Matchbox type cars. <P>Oh yeah. Coffee cups. My wife hates 'em. Or pretends to. <BR>"Oh noooo!!! Not another mug?!"   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 11-05-2001).]||||reg||1
