Z||000039||DaRkLoRD||11-08-2001||05:21 PM||||-designing/building just about anything.. (inventions.. architecture.. carpentry.. electronics.. you name it)<BR>-fixing & repairing rooms/houses.. painting, plastering, adding trim, floor tiles, etc.. heck I can even fix a room and then decide what color to paint the walls, and pick matching furniture and cool pictures for the wall... though my personal choice is white walls, back furniture, grey carpet, and cool black & white cityscape pictures for the walls.. though landscapes and astronomy pics look nice too. (not like it's hard. just another form of art..)<BR>-cooking<BR>-computers/graphics/web pages<BR>-DRIVING!!<BR>-sci-fi novels<BR>-studying physics, engineering (mostly alternative energy like hydrogen, solar)<BR>-swimming, but only in nice heated pools...<P>and thanks to my biotech class.. I've become very interested in hydroponics.. and no, I am not growing weed.. just giant tomatoes. hehehe (if anyone's interested I can post a 3D rendering of my setup.. looks much nicer than the actual setup, it's just some cheap wood screwed together with some trays and a shop light)<P>oh, and it's not much of a hobby, but I've recently become quite interested in investing, stocks, etc..<P>------------------<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>      <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><P>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 11-08-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 11-08-2001).]||||reg||3
